videos/stock-market-101-ep02-sensex-nifty/audio/track/
videos/stock-market-101-ep02-vo/audio/track/
# Beauty spec series (Kylie Cosmetics, Rare Beauty, Typsy): the brands' films, licensed webfonts, site screenshots, the
# Mixkit guide tracks and extracted frames are fetched by scripts/fetch_sources.sh, never committed (Typsy's fonts are OFL)
videos/kylie-cosmetics-spec/source/*
